<div align="center">

# 🐘 PostgreSQL Laboratory Works

*A comprehensive collection of practical laboratory works, SQL scripts, and administrative exercises covering modern PostgreSQL database management, design, and optimization.*

</div>

---

## 📂 Repository Structure

| Lab | Topic / Description | Key Concepts & Tools |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Lab 3** | Basic `psql` Command Line Interface | CLI setup, database connection, meta-commands |
| **Lab 4** | First SQL Queries & Core Syntax | `SELECT`, filtering, basic projection |
| **Lab 5** | Database Architecture & Management | Creating and configuring database instances |
| **Lab 6** | Tables, Data Types & Field Constraints | Data types, `NOT NULL`, `CHECK`, `UNIQUE` |
| **Lab 7** | Primary Keys & Data Integrity | Entity integrity, primary key constraints |
| **Lab 8** | Foreign Keys & Relational Schemas | Referential integrity, `REFERENCES`, cascades |
| **Lab 9** | Fundamentals of Relational Database Design | Normalization principles, schema layout |
| **Lab 10** | Database & Table Structure Inspection | System catalogs, schema introspection |
| **Lab 11** | Basic Data Operations | `INSERT`, `UPDATE`, `DELETE`, transactions |
| **Lab 12** | Advanced Querying & Filtering | Pattern matching (`LIKE`, Regex), sorting |
| **Lab 13** | Aggregation & Grouping Functions | `GROUP BY`, `HAVING`, aggregate metrics |
| **Lab 14** | Table Joins | `INNER`, `LEFT`, `RIGHT`, `FULL OUTER JOIN` |
| **Lab 15** | CTEs, Subqueries & Window Functions | `WITH`, `RANK()`, `ROW_NUMBER()`, partitions |
| **Lab 16** | Transactions, Isolation Levels & ACID | `BEGIN`, `COMMIT`, `ROLLBACK`, `SAVEPOINT` |
| **Lab 17** | Data Import/Export, Staging & Backup | `COPY`, `pg_dump`, `pg_restore`, ETL staging |

---

## 🛠 Tech Stack & Tools

* **Database Management System:** PostgreSQL 
* **Graphical Interface:** pgAdmin 4
* **Command Line Utilities:** `psql`, `pg_dump`, `pg_restore`
